## Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    Frontend (React SPA)                      │
│  MapLibre GL  │  Cytoscape.js  │  Recharts  │  RAG Chat     │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                           │ HTTPS
┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│              Catalyst API Gateway (Auth + Routing)           │
└──────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                           │
┌──────────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│              Catalyst Serverless Functions                   │
│  FIR Ingestion │ NER │ Entity Resolution │ Link Analysis    │
│  Anomaly Detection │ Fairness Check │ Audit Logging         │
└──────┬───────────────────────┬──────────────────┬───────────┘
       │                       │                  │
┌──────▼──────────┐  ┌────────▼───────┐  ┌───────▼──────────┐
│ Catalyst Data   │  │ Catalyst       │  │ Catalyst QuickML │
│ Store (Rel)     │  │ NoSQL (Unstr.) │  │ LLM + AutoML     │
│ Catalyst Stratus│  │                │  │ AppSail (Python) │
└─────────────────┘  └────────────────┘  └──────────────────┘
```

## Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS |
| Maps | MapLibre GL (open-source Mapbox GL fork) |
| Graphs | Cytoscape.js |
| Charts | Recharts |
| API & Logic | Catalyst Serverless Functions (Node.js) |
| ML Serving | Catalyst AppSail (Python: NetworkX, scikit-learn) |
| AI/LLM | Catalyst QuickML (LLM Serving, RAG, AutoML) |
| Relational Data | Catalyst Data Store |
| Unstructured Data | Catalyst NoSQL |
| File Storage | Catalyst Stratus |
| Auth | Catalyst Authentication |
| Automation | Catalyst Cron |
| Containerization | Docker + Docker Compose |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions |

