| Classification | Description |
|----------------|-------------|
| Public | Open government data, license-cleared |
| Synthetic | Faker-generated demo data (all person-level data) |
| Internal | Design documents, architecture, plans |
| Confidential | Security assessments, threat models |
| Restricted | Future integration contracts only |

